. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jp1bkZ2-jkYQ7kNvwH_9P3h&_nc_oc=Ado7ff6feFsqHa-GSIBvcoc8IyNaxjZJIaEJIGSRvh9sZOvHcawzlcpjJTVK8khx5ks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB11YqRonBvB9xodHNKxJ8w_7B3jXUhyeBb8exfzCOZtA&oe=6A4F9BBE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KQDF2SwzvJ4Q7kNvwGgUBZ8&_nc_oc=AdoskST7nmZuAxekBoZxqmTDY6_7t0vgigDO6oDAGIYOyQ2d62DNsCKw9UGMDFFnwv0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCE22Tqu7mSODj5mTnHdQfQWOqs1PNfGZCpnQrXUEU6tA&oe=6A4FB25E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B9BnXx2S7fgQ7kNvwHvk42R&_nc_oc=AdqjaZjkiaTC5K-2YaaUmw1pxyMVvTfZxNvzMCjyz7kZImXhPZcAKC2rOZjCZ6-59B8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDET07pE4hsGbDWg1zG-CUbXEFCHYByyc1cHB86uWPaNg&oe=6A4FA7DB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco